  heroes  flags.with_delimiter
  go      -
  rust    clap::Arg::value_delimiter, Command::dont_delimit_trailing_values
  python  -
  note    each piece is checked as the argument's kind reads a value; an empty piece is a value

capability flags/missing-value  an option given alone taking a declared value, `--color` for `--color=always`
  heroes  flags.with_missing_value
  go      -
